{"unit_id":"Wanderingss__dsh-ws-deflate#card-zh","repo":"Wanderingss/dsh-ws-deflate","commit":"dc815facd996574afc54c1e8a8fcc4921f62e28f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ws-deflate 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 WebSocket 压缩插件，为会话传输启用 permessage-deflate。它通过 Cordis bundle 注册，在握手时为 gateway 使用的 WebSocketServer 配置压缩，并可按帧大小阈值、压缩级别及并发上限调整行为。插件还提供激活时的 loopback 协商自测、状态查询和协商日志，适合通过远程或高延迟链路使用 DSH Web 的用户。安装后不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:62-81","lib/index.js:178-214","lib/index.js:364-449","cordis.patch.yml:31-33"]}
